      mechanismEn: "Blockade of the delayed rectifier cardiac potassium channel (IKr/hERG).",
      managementVi: "Tr\xE1nh ph\u1ED1i h\u1EE3p \u1EDF b\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n c\xF3 ti\u1EC1n s\u1EED QT d\xE0i (QTc > 470ms \u1EDF nam, > 480ms \u1EDF n\u1EEF), h\u1EA1 kali/magie m\xE1u, ho\u1EB7c \u0111ang d\xF9ng thu\u1ED1c ch\u1ED1ng lo\u1EA1n nh\u1ECBp nh\xF3m IA/III. Moxifloxacin c\xF3 nguy c\u01A1 cao nh\u1EA5t trong nh\xF3m FQ.",
